        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Chiefdom</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 5000 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Power held by</span><span class="info-stat-val">A paramount chief from the senior line of a ranked descent group, above lesser chiefs who ruled villages or districts and passed tribute upward</span></div>
